# CAR HOP pays once per car in the gap's again (30 s): the boneless over the parked car's trunk from
# sf-goal-carhop, then the same hop again 3.3 s later (a teleport stands in for riding round):
# only the first pays; the same car again 31 s after the first pays again. (Hopping one parked car
# back and forth paid 500 every time.)
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport -62.3 -322 2.31 0
cmd 1 car -51.1 -331.2 356 0
cmd 30 teleport -41.25 -332.19 2.08 265.2
cmd 40 set skater.vel.x -5.98
cmd 40 set skater.vel.y -0.5
hold ollie 42..140
tap up 124
tap up 132
cmd 430 teleport -41.25 -332.19 2.08 265.2
cmd 440 set skater.vel.x -5.98
cmd 440 set skater.vel.y -0.5
hold ollie 442..540
tap up 524
tap up 532
cmd 3730 teleport -41.25 -332.19 2.08 265.2
cmd 3740 set skater.vel.x -5.98
cmd 3740 set skater.vel.y -0.5
hold ollie 3742..3840
tap up 3824
tap up 3832
run 4100
expect event gap{id=car_hop,points=500} count == 2
expect event gap{id=car_hop} within 280..282
expect event comboLanded{name=Boneless,points=150,multiplier=1} within 690..694
expect event gap{id=car_hop} within 3980..3982
expect no event bail
